31,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The first night has passed. Did anyone notice anything?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm just worried about who might be the werewolf.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have information. Ryuji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"That's a bold claim, Asuka. I assume you're the Seer?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh! Asuka, are you sure? That's quite a shock.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, if you're the Seer, that's a very direct approach. Are you sure you want to reveal yourself so early?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,If Asuka says so... but it's so sudden.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Efficiency is better than secrecy in this case. We found the werewolf on day one.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It's a classic bluff. Asuka could be the werewolf trying to frame me immediately to gain trust.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
