41,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, how do you respond to the accusation other than calling it a bluff?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't know who to believe.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Ryuji's response is predictable. He's trying to sow doubt.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm simply pointing out the logical flaw in trusting a self-proclaimed Seer without proof.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think we should trust Asuka. Her logic is usually sound.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm inclined to believe Asuka. The risk of her lying as a werewolf this early is high.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll go with the majority.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The evidence is clear to me. Let's vote.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
